---
interface Props { locale?: 'en' | 'zh-tw'; }
const { locale = 'en' } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh-tw';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<!-- Author: OpenAI-Codex_Responsible: Modpack_Website. -->
<aside class="project-status-summary" lang={zh ? 'zh-TW' : 'en'} aria-label={zh ? '專案狀態' : 'Project status'}>
	<div class="page-wrap">
		<p><strong>{zh ? '截至 2026 年 11 月 2 日，15 個模組均已有工作坊項目；14 個未暫停模組已有成功的雲端 DLL 建置。' : 'As of 2 November 2026, all 15 modules have Workshop items and 14 non-paused modules have successful cloud DLL builds.'}</strong> {zh ? '工作坊可見性各有不同，項目建立及 22 項替代方向不代表功能完成。AI Gaming 開發已暫停；模組組合及工作坊訂閱版本尚未通過遊戲驗收。' : 'Workshop availability varies. The 22 replacement directions are not completed features. AI Gaming development is paused; combined-mod and subscribed-game acceptance remain unverified.'}</p>
		<a href={base + (zh ? 'zh-tw/' : '') + 'wiki/project/status/'}>{zh ? '模組狀態與替代目標' : 'Module status and replacement targets'}</a>
	</div>
</aside>

<style>
	.project-status-summary { padding: 20px var(--margin); border-block: 1px solid var(--field); }
	p { max-width: 85ch; font-size: 15px; }
	a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; margin-top: 8px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
</style>

